<title>USA: Harris County, Texas, bonds repriced, ylds raised.</title>
<headline>Harris County, Texas, bonds repriced, ylds raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said Monday it repriced Harris County, Texas's $238.9 million general obligation bond issue, raising yields in several maturities and lifting the 2023 maturity to 5.85 percent from 5.82 percent.</p>
